{"seq":2,"slug":"deferred","title":"延迟深链与归因","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/deferred","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deferred-deep-link-flow","title":"延迟深链流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/deferred/deferred-deep-link-flow","wordCount":986,"readingTime":4},{"seq":2,"slug":"fingerprint-attribution","title":"指纹归因技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/deferred/fingerprint-attribution","wordCount":1277,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"clipboard-paste-detection","title":"剪贴板与粘贴检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-deep-linking/deferred/clipboard-paste-detection","wordCount":1233,"readingTime":5}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"延迟深链与归因\">延迟深链与归因</h1><p>Universal Links 和 App Links 解决了&quot;App 已安装时的跳转&quot;问题，但当用户点击链接时 App 尚未安装，这个意图就丢失了。延迟深链（Deferred Deep Link）技术在安装和首次启动之间架起一座桥梁，让用户完成安装后依然能到达最初的目标页面。本章还覆盖支撑这一机制的设备指纹技术和剪贴板检测方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>内容摘要</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"deferred-deep-link-flow\">延迟深链流程</a></td>\n<td>安装前意图保存、安装后首次打开意图恢复的端到端流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"fingerprint-attribution\">指纹归因技术</a></td>\n<td>设备指纹的信号组合、概率匹配算法、Branch/AppsFlyer SDK 机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"clipboard-paste-detection\">剪贴板与粘贴检测</a></td>\n<td>iOS UIPasteboard 限制、Android 剪贴板 API、隐私合规处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>延迟深链的核心挑战是：在 App 沙盒隔离和隐私限制不断加强的前提下，如何安全、可靠地传递用户意图。三篇文档从流程、技术机制到具体实现逐层展开。</p>\n"}